scheduler_predicted_wait_seconds | HISTOGRAM | The wait a work-aware strategy predicted for the worker it chose at decision time, (work ahead + the request's estimated cost) / the worker's estimated token rate, by model. A model-based estimate, not a measurement; absent for decisions without a capacity estimate. | labels=model | buckets=0.005,0.01,0.025,0.05,0.1,0.25,0.5,1,2.5,5,10,30,60,120
scheduler_signal_fallbacks_total | COUNTER | Decisions in which a work-aware strategy lacked a signal for the chosen worker, by model and reason (cold_start: a fleet prior or simpler rule stood in; untracked: the ledger does not follow the worker; invalid: a signal was unusable and scored neutrally). | labels=model,reason | buckets=
